benchmark_unavailable_editeval_2026_07_20
  record_type "benchmark_unavailable"
  suite "editeval"
  date "2026-07-20"
  reason "EditEval ships an evaluation harness with no task payload (configs/dataset_paths.json points at per-corpus download directories), and its constituent corpora fail the permissive-only policy: ASSET is CC BY-NC 4.0 and JFLEG is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The instructed-text-editing requirement is executed through the Apache-2.0 CoEdIT suite instead."
  evidence "recorded by `formal-ai benchmark run --append`; no repository-local proxy is substituted"
benchmark_unavailable_swebench_lite_2026_07_20
  record_type "benchmark_unavailable"
  suite "swebench_lite"
  date "2026-07-20"
  reason "The original capture compared candidate text with the gold patch instead of running the official SWE-bench tests, so that row was not a valid SWE-bench score and has been withdrawn. A scheduled run records a score only through the pinned official evaluator."
  evidence "benchmark_unavailable is explicit; no proxy score is retained"
